{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03983","headline":"三月三日宴王明府山亭 · 席元明","name":"三月三日宴王明府山亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日惟上巳，时亨有巢。\n中尊引桂，芳筵籍茅。\n书僮橐笔，膳夫行炰。\n烟霏万雉，花明四郊。\n沼苹白带，山花紫苞。\n同人聚饮，千载神交。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"席元明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}